{% extends "layout.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="sg-grid-row">
  <div class="sg-two-thirds">
    <h1 class="sg-heading-xl">Apply for and manage farming grants</h1>
    <p class="sg-lead">
      SmartGrant helps farmers and land managers apply for Sustainable Farming Incentive,
      Countryside Stewardship and capital grants in one place — and helps RPA case officers
      process claims faster with AI-assisted mapping validation and risk triage.
    </p>

    <p>Use this service to:</p>
    <ul class="sg-list sg-list--bullet">
      <li>apply for a grant against a registered land parcel</li>
      <li>get instant mapping validation of your claimed area</li>
      <li>track the progress of your applications and payments</li>
      <li>see exactly why any automated check flagged your claim</li>
    </ul>

    <a href="{{ '/dashboard' if currentUser and currentUser.role == 'farmer' else ('/casework' if currentUser else '/register') }}" class="sg-button sg-button--start">
      Start now
      <svg class="sg-button__start-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17.5" height="19" viewBox="0 0 33 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h13l20 20-20 20H0l20-20z"/></svg>
    </a>

    <p>Already have an account? <a href="/login">Sign in</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="sg-heading-m">How decisions are made</h2>
    <p>
      Automated checks in this service are <strong>advisory only</strong>. Every payment
      decision is made and signed off by a named RPA case officer, with a full audit trail —
      mandatory human-in-the-loop, as set out in the assessment this prototype delivers.
    </p>

    <div class="sg-inset-text">
      <p><strong>Why this service exists.</strong> {{ concept.problemStatement }}</p>
      <p><a href="/about">Read the evidence behind SmartGrant</a> — gap {{ gap.id }} ({{ gap.gap | lower }}), ranked {{ gap.rank }} of 10 in the Stage 1 gap analysis.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sg-one-third">
    <aside class="sg-related" aria-labelledby="related-title">
      <h2 class="sg-heading-s" id="related-title">For RPA case officers</h2>
      <p>Sign in to see the casework queue, prioritised by claim-risk triage, and delivery reports.</p>
      <p><a href="/login">Officer sign in</a></p>
      <h2 class="sg-heading-s">Demo accounts</h2>
      <p class="sg-body-s">Farmer: <code>farmer@farm.demo</code> / <code>FarmerDemo1</code><br>
      Officer: <code>officer@rpa.demo</code> / <code>OfficerDemo1</code></p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
